<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361584" n="1"/>
  <opener><lb/>Viro Illustrisso. et Celebmo. <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolao Bernoullj</rs>
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-102552517">Petrus Antus. Michelotti</rs> S. P. D. </opener>
  <p><lb/>Inveni <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patrui</rs> Tui <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_BS83R2A4 biblio_WIW87HR7">Dissertationes</rs> antequam
      <lb/>hodiernae tuae ad me delatae sint <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517026505501">litterae</rs>, ex qui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus intelligo Te istinc in <rs type="place">Patriam</rs> <date>die Jovis</date> pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>fecturum. Precor Deos immortales ut Te prote<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gant in itinere, et ut securum Te in <rs type="place">Patriam</rs> perve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nire faciant. Mittam <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517026505501">litteras</rs> (si advenient)
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="place_GEO-3178829">Clavennam</rs> uti jubes. Te rogo ut statim ac in <rs type="place">Pa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>triam</rs> deveneris me certiorem facias, de fascic<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ulo mearum scriptarum moneas, quod Tibi
      <lb/>etiam atque etiam commendo.</p> <closer>Vale semper
      <lb/>Vir Amicissime, et
                              me dilige.
                                    <dateline>Dabam <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1719-10-10">a. d. 10 Octobris 1719</date>.</dateline></closer>
<note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895"><foreign xml:lang="ger"><abbr>Empf.</abbr> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1719-10-11">11<hi rend="sup">ten</hi></date></foreign></note>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>